@startuml
title Signal Read — Arch Flow

actor "Vehicle\n(ECU)" as Vehicle
participant "CAN Bus" as Bus
participant "Reader\n(decode)" as Reader
participant "Queue" as Queue
participant "Pipeline\n(process)" as Pipeline
participant "Store" as Store
participant "WebSocket" as WS
participant "Frontend" as Frontend

== Read flow: CAN → Dashboard ==
Vehicle -> Bus : CAN frame (ID, data)
Bus -> Reader : recv_loop() thread
Reader -> Reader : Decode (ID → signal)
Reader -> Queue : enqueue frame
Queue -> Pipeline : batch drain
Pipeline -> Pipeline : Process (RateLimiter,\nComputedSignals)
Pipeline -> Store : bulk_update
Store -> WS : notify_subscribers
WS -> Frontend : WebSocket push (JSON)

note right of Pipeline
  Current stages: RateLimiter, ComputedSignals.
  Realtime samples remain in SignalStore and
  are not persisted to SQLite.
end note

@enduml
